{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_08_end",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_08",
  "title": "滲透作戰",
  "storyCode": "OD-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "17d731d45dfd34723f505fcde8ab0a9acb3cf067d4b464c9b818365d267b8e82",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "這東西還在動！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "炸彈部署完了，我們得撤了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "它......好像在重生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這東西......到底算什麼生物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "不管它是什麼，這東西都不應該存在於這個世界上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我們得撤了，要趕在炸彈爆炸之前跑出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "走這邊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我沒子彈了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "巡林者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "我還在......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "你的情況看起來可不太好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "老了，老了......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "你的手怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "剛才沒躲開，小問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "現在怎麼辦？要去避難所嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "礦洞那邊，還沒消息嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "老夫也沒想到我們能堅持這麼久......不過也快到極限了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "你在幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "弄一面盾牌，我其實早想這麼試試了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "這就像是回到了過去，那些有關榮耀的美好時光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "年輕的巡林者們集結在鎮子的入口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "明知道大軍壓境，明知道在戰爭之後他們中很多人都會血灑這片荒地之上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "但是他們有說有笑，高呼著戰歌，仿佛敵人是不堪一擊的蟲子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "戰爭殘忍無情，有人退縮了，更多人決定死守到底。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "倒下的人成為了傳奇，站著的人負責銘記他們的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "最後站著的那個人，也慢慢開始畏懼死亡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "因為他不想忘記那些倒下的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "哈哈哈......也許是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "很榮幸和你並肩作戰，亞歷山大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我也很榮幸，巡林者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "不要這麼悲觀，我還沒有放棄戰鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我就是用砸的，也要敲死幾個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "等等......那是什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "是援軍！哈哈哈哈哈哈！我們得救了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "這個手法......是那個年輕人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "我收到了求救信號，本來以為只是一次普通的救援任務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "我沒有想到會在這裡遇到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "老遊俠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "你重操舊業了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "哈哈，老了老了，讓你看笑話了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "你的彎刀呢，遊俠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "年紀大了，早就耍不動了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "若不是你來，今天我這把老骨頭怕是要交代在這裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "你謙虛了，老遊俠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "小隊注意，目標在領主宅邸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "敵人是危險的變異源石生物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "隨時彙報位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "當心點，它們數量很多，讓你的人儘量避免落單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "還有，注意地下，它們會鑽洞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "很榮幸與你並肩戰鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "“血色山谷的彎刀”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
